ren</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Metastatic neoplasms in the thyroid gland. Pathological and clinical findings</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1962</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>557</fpage><lpage>565</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">13911946</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/1097-0142(196205/06)15:3&#x0003c;557::AID-CNCR2820150315&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-H</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Perry</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Gore</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Seigler</surname><given-names>HF</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnston</surname><given-names>WW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fine needle aspiration biopsy of metastatic melanoma:a morphologic analysis of 174 cases</article-title><source>Acta Cytol</source><year>1986</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>385</fpage><lpage>396</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3461649</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Caselitz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Janner</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Breitbart</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Weber</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Osborn</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Malignant melanomas contain only the vimentin type of intermediate filaments</article-title><source>Virchows Arch A Pathol Anat Histopathol</source><year>1983</year><volume>400</volume><fpage>43</fpage><lpage>51</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6190301</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF00627007</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>